<title>USA: Disney to release &quot;Jungle&quot; on video July 29.</title>
<headline>Disney to release &quot;Jungle&quot; on video July 29.</headline>
<dateline>BURBANK, Calif. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walt Disney Co said it will release the threatrical film &quot;Jungle 2 Jungle&quot; on the home video market in the U.S. on July 29.</p>
<p>The video will be priced at $22.99 and will include a $5 consumer mail-in rebate coupon.</p>
<p>The film, which stars comedic actor Tim Allen, did $52 million at the box office, Disney said.</p>
